        rdfs:comment                   "Bonnet veil of bobbin lace, made in Caen, France, ca 1850"@en , "Bonnet veil of semi-circular shape made of black silk bobbin lace. The straight edge is plain and the curved edge is decorated with a border of ovals and single-flower motifs, between bands of leaves. The ground is patterned with rows of dots."@en ;
